[{"id":176715560,"discussion_id":"e768ae71ce0d1373351ac0fe59db71a1df1060eb","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| pkg_inc | ✅ [*王永光*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_) (2/2) | ✅ [*王永光*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n Sunee, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-23T16:16:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T09:28:17+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176724744,"discussion_id":"8da669f31fccfb38af7a3523605fcbf556bd2c34","body":"我已逐行审查了该文件 `pkg_inc/op_common/atvoss/reduce/reduce_sch_aux_base.h` 中的 diff，并结合周围上下文进行了深入分析。以下是我的结论：\n\n- **该文件审查完毕**：变更集中在 `PostReduce` 模板函数（第 617–644 行）。核心逻辑是将原先按 `sizeof(InDType) != sizeof(OutDType)` 运行时分支（混合精度场景）分别设置 `srcStride` 和 `newShape` 的旧写法，统一改为在 `if constexpr (Pattern::TailA)` 的编译期分支内同时为 `srcStride` 和 `newShape.value[1]` 赋值，且 `!TailA` 分支始终使用 `outLen`（而非旧的混用 `inDtypeBlockAlign` 与 `outLen`）。代码中未发现拼写错误、缓冲区溢出、内存泄漏、空指针解引用、整除/溢出或返回值未检查等缺陷。变更命名规范（`minDtypeBlockAlign`）、类型使用（`uint64_t`）均合理，且注释与代码语义匹配。因此，该文件 **no issues**。\n\n---\n\n#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `LpNormV2` 在 Reduce 后处理阶段（`PostReduce`）的精度问题。改动位于 `reduce_sch_aux_base.h`，将原先基于 `sizeof(InDType) != sizeof(OutDType)` 运行时判断来分别设定 `srcStride` 和 `newShape` 的逻辑，统一收拢到 `if constexpr (Pattern::TailA)` 编译期分支中，使 `srcStride` 与 shape 在各自分支内保持一致，消除了旧代码中 `!TailA` 路径下 stride 与 shape 不对齐导致的精度偏差。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **统一 `TailA`/`!TailA` 分支的 stride 与 shape 赋值**：在 `PostReduce` 中，将 `newView.axis[1].srcStride` 和 `newShape.value[1]` 的赋值合并到同一个 `if constexpr (Pattern::TailA)` 分支内。`TailA` 分支使用 `minDtypeBlockAlign`（对齐后的值），`!TailA` 分支统一使用 `outLen`，不再根据 `InDType` 与 `OutDType` 大小差异做区分。\n- **移除混合精度的运行时分支**：删除了 `if (sizeof(InDType) != sizeof(OutDType))` 的运行时判断，消除了该路径下 `srcStride` 与 `newShape` 取值不一致的根源。\n- **变量重命名与位置调整**：将 `inDtypeBlockAlign` 重命名为 `minDtypeBlockAlign`（更准确反映其基于 `MIN_DTYPE_BYTES` 计算的含义），并将 `S newShape` 的声明和 `newShape.value[0] = 1` 初始化移至 `CalculateOutView` 调用之前，不影响语义。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-23T16:45:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-23T16:45:11+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176725750,"discussion_id":"76781b1504fce4f3cba4664daa6232a6803c63b5","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n经审查，本次变更（`reduce_sch_aux_base.h`）共涉及 1 个文件、+7/-11 行，是对 `PostReduce` 函数中 `LpNormV2` 精度问题的修复。\n\n**变更评估：**\n\n此变更将 `PostReduce` 中的 `srcStride` 设置条件和 `newShape.value[1]` 计算逻辑与同文件中 `CopyOutGroup`（第685-689行）已有的模式对齐：\n- `srcStride` 的判断从运行时 `sizeof(InDType) != sizeof(OutDType)`（混合精度）改为编译期 `Pattern::TailA`（RA模式），修正了 TailA+同尺寸类型场景下 stride 未 block-align 的旧有缺陷；\n- `!TailA` 分支的 `newShape.value[1]` 从 `outRepeat * CeilAlign(outLen, ...)` 改为 `outRepeat * outLen`，去除了多余的 block 对齐填充，使下游拿到真实数据尺寸以修复精度。\n\n变更逻辑正确，与已有代码模式一致。\n\n**发现问题汇总：**\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P0     | 0    |\n| P1     | 0    |\n| P2     | 0    |\n| P3     | 1    |\n\n- **P3** ×1：第634行注释\"混合精度场景\"不再准确反映已改为 `Pattern::TailA` 的分支条件，建议更新注释。\n\n**整体风险判断：低风险。** 变更将 `PostReduce` 对齐到 `CopyOutGroup` 的既定模式，修复了 TailA 同尺寸类型的 stride 对齐问题和 `!TailA` 的 shape 过度填充问题，逻辑自洽。\n\n---\n\n**已审查文件清单：**\n\n- `pkg_inc/op_common/atvoss/reduce/reduce_sch_aux_base.h`：已审查，发现 1 个 P3 建议。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 0 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 1 |\n\n\uD83D\uDCAC 仅评论\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-23T16:48:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-23T16:48:07+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176725753,"discussion_id":"50e9932237baa01f07c17227eaa1aaa54dd6a212","body":"\uD83D\uDD35 **Low Priority**\n\n\n\n**建议**：将注释更新为准确描述当前分支逻辑，例如：\"// TailA(RA)模式下MTE3搬出需要跳搬，按minDtype对齐stride(混合精度如lp_norm_v2存在此场景)\"","created_at":"2026-06-23T16:48:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T09:28:23+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486